{"title": "Dark Lady's Ire (Condition)", "pageid": 44279, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dark_Lady's_Ire_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Debuff Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Dark Lady's Ire</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Has earned Shar's condemnation due to a poor display of charm. Has a -5 penalty to <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> until finishing a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SCL_PLAQUES_CHA_FAIL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SCL_PLAQUES_CHA_FAIL+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SCL_PLAQUES_CHA_FAIL+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Dark_Lady.27s_Ire\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Dark_Lady's_Ire\">Sources of Dark Lady's Ire</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Acquired from a Statue of Shar after failing an ability check in the Sharran Sanctuary of Act II.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201637\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 712/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6796/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2518/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977988/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.074      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   37.074      1 -total\n 55.46%   20.561      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 22.77%    8.443      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 18.28%    6.775      3 Template:Template_style\n 12.20%    4.522      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.90%    4.042      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  9.23%    3.423      1 Template:Uid_style\n  5.14%    1.907      9 Template:Trim\n  3.82%    1.416      1 Template:NorbyteLink\n-->\n